	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ternas his duobus mensibus abs te literas accepi, eximie vir <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>et venerande frater.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Primis scribebas D. <persName ref="p8111">Petrum Martyrem</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>et D. <persName ref="p8011">Gualtherum</persName> huc venturos, te vero impediri incommoda <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>valetudine.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">De privati colloquii successu monebas exiguam spem <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>esse, quando ubique primas obtinet <persName ref="p458">Brentius</persName>, homo pręfractus et <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nimium addictus crassis suis deliriis.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Etsi autem ego quoque non semel <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>testatus sum, quantopere metuendi sint tales congressus me videre, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>nolim tamen ita refugere ut de nostra diffidentia triumphum agant <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>adversarii.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Cęterum quia, mihi retulerunt optimi fratres <persName ref="p1049">Farellus</persName> et <lb xml:id="p1z10"/><persName ref="p8033">Beza</persName>, si oblata fuerit colloquendi occasio, te ad eam amplexandam <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>sponte esse propensum, a alongiori sermone abstineo: nisi quod te <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>summopere rogatum velim ut clarissimus senatus vester hortatu <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>tuo vicinos nostros impellat.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Neque enim repudianda est Principis <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>voluntas, quem putavimus esse a nobis alienum, et festinatione opus <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>est ut mature intelligat nostrorum vota ad suum consilium accedere.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Quum vero hoc totum onus sustinendum tibi sit, nisi festines et s<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>trenue urgeas, temendum est ne cupide alii tempus silentio <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>prętereant.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Iam quia expedit, imo fere necesse est, testem <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>idoneum mitti qui <placeName>Wirtebergensem</placeName> principem de pollicitatione <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>sua appellet, vide annon mittendus sit cum altero vel pluribus <lb xml:id="p1z21"/><persName ref="p8033">Beza</persName> noster.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Quanquam si quid videbis esse negocii, ne minimum quidem <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>scrupulum iniici velim: quia plus satis aliunde erit remorę.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Quod <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>tamen venturum tibi sponte in mentem erat libere exponere volui, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>tantum ut cogites.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Confessionis nulla mentio hoc tempore, si <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>mihi creditur, fiet.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Nam si difficilis esset accessus, hęc esset commoda <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>insinuandi ratio.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Nunc si quis turbator actioni se volet opponere, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>obiiciet, antequam ad colloquium ventum fuerit, nos leges pręscribere: <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>et nullus interea usus est, quum ipse Princeps anteverterit.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Imo nihil magis causam nostram iuvabit quam si pro confesso <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>sumamus eandem nbois esse doctrinam, et uno duntaxat capite <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>excepto inter nos sancte convenire.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Confessio autem de re certa et <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>liquida controversiam moveret.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p3375">Vergerio</persName> non dixi quid agere <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>statuerim.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Scribam, ubi dabitur opportunitas, D. <persName ref="p8041">Ioanni a Lasco</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>ne r<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>igidius premendo excutiat fratres <placeName>Waldenses</placeName> a nostro grege.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Nihil tamen agam nisi te conscio.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Huic tantum dixi, optimum virum <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>D. <persName ref="p8041">a Lasco</persName> interdum solere austerum esse: sed quia causa hęc mihi <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>nondum est comperta non pronunciare: <placeName>Waldenses</placeName> ante annos 16, quum <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>adhuc essem <placeName ref="l491">Argentorati</placeName>, misisse confessionem quę optimo <persName ref="p467">Bucero</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>et mihi tunc probata fuit: sed mihi postea ostensum fuisse exemplar <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>quoddam, in quo nonnulla mihi displicent et quę nollem admittere.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/>Vale, ornatissime vir et frater ex animo mihi observande, una cum <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>D. <persName ref="p8111">Martyre</persName> et collegis omnibus.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Symmystę mei vos omnes reverenter <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>salutant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Dominus vos tueatur, sustentet, omni benedictione locuplete.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z45"/><placeName ref="l167">Genevę</placeName> 3. Calendas Iunii 1557.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z46"/><persName ref="p540">Ioannes Calvinus</persName> vere tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Ornatissimo viro et eximio <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Christi servo <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>D. <persName ref="p495">Henricho Bullingero</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ecclesię <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> fido <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>pastori et symmystę <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>observando.</s>
				</p>
